l},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-20T15:29:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T00:18:18Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.official [github](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/49a5bc7b616bd04689a2c89e89bda41f50241464) (from Google Play Store)\n\n\n### System information\n\nandroid 14 (phone, tablet)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the Android keyboard is invoked in Godot and then closed using the back button/gesture, the very next back gesture (intended for app navigation) fails to work. A second gesture is required. This suggests a problem in how Godot handles the sequence of back events, specifically the one immediately following the dismissal of the keyboard.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch the Godot application on an Android device.\n2. Select any text input field (for example, the \"Project Filter\" search bar). The Android soft keyboard will open.\n3. Use the Android back gesture or the physical/virtual back button to close the keyboard.\n4. Attempt to exit Godot by performing the back gesture (or pressing the back button) again.\n  - Expected Result: The application should close or navigate to the previous screen (e.g., the device's home screen or previous app).\n  - Actual Result: Nothing happens. The back event is ignored.\n\n5. Perform the back gesture one more time.\n  - Result: The application now exits as expected.\n  \nNote: It appears that on step 4, the Godot engine fails to capture or process the back event from the Android system.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38d95afb-ff39-4606-b594-740f19b2c6e0\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny Godot project with a text input field and Android back button handling will reproduce this issue.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109806/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109806/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}